In taverns and other places there are boards where anybody leaves notes
for the rest. Looking at a board shows its commands and the new notes,
marked with an N.

  read [number]         read a note, or the first one you have not read
  subjects              list every note
  post <subject>        write a new note
  followup <number>     answer a note with another note
  mudmail <number>      answer whoever wrote the note with a letter
  eat <number>          tear down a note of yours

Notes are written with your editor. 'mudmail' opens a letter to the
author of the note, with the same subject, and you do not need to be at
a post office to send it.

On some boards only coders write, and guests cannot write on any.
